## 9. Required Invariants

Audited invariants:

* DRS record is not truth
* DRS hit is not authority
* DRS reuse candidate is not action permission
* DRS freshness is advisory, not final authority
* stale DRS record cannot silently reuse
* quarantined/deadend proximity forces review
* conflicting provenance blocks direct ready/reuse
* Root remains final authority
* resolver cannot mutate manifest
* resolver cannot mutate transition matrix
* resolver cannot call network/Gemini/connectors
* writeback cannot create production persistence claims
* local file-backed DRS is still not production DRS

## 10. Limitations

* not production DRS
* not external/global DRS
* no network
* no Gemini
* no autonomous action
* no connector side effects
* no public WOW
* no whitepaper/public auditor packet
* no Marennya
* no UP
* no self-modifying manifest
* no transition matrix mutation
* not separate DRS Poisoning Resistance v0.1
* not Economic Adversary v0.1
* Real Semantic Runtime MVP not complete

## 11. Auditor Conclusion

PASS.

Real Local DRS Resolver / Writeback v0.1 successfully adds a bounded local
runtime-facing DRS primitive for writing meaning, resolving meaning, and
presenting reuse candidates under Root review.

The implementation preserves the central boundary: local DRS records and hits
can inform review, but they do not become truth, authority, direct reuse
permission, action permission, production persistence, or Root Final authority.

Root remains final authority.
